<title>SOUTH AFRICA: IBCA upgrades New Republic Bank rating.</title>
<headline>IBCA upgrades New Republic Bank rating.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>European credit rating agency IBCA said on Monday it had upgraded the domestic short-term rating of New Republic Bank Ltd to A2 from A3 and accorded for the first time a long-term rating of BBB.</p>
<p>&quot;Recapitalised and under new management, NRB appears to have found a renewed focus and has been given greater flexibility to deal with underlying concerns,&quot; IBCA said in a statement.</p>
<p>NRB's major shareholder is SMG Holdings Ltd, which is controlled by Dato' Samsudin Abu Hassan.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
